#AI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="ruby-rails"
DISPLAY_NAME="Ruby / Rails"

DESCRIPTION:
Ruby on Rails web applications. API-only or full-stack with Hotwire/Turbo.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      Ruby 3.3+
- Framework:     Rails 7.x or 8.x
- Dependency:    Bundler (Gemfile)
- Test:          RSpec + FactoryBot + Capybara
- Lint:          RuboCop (rubocop-rails + rubocop-rspec)
- Type:          Sorbet or RBS (optional but recommended)

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.ai → .claude/rules/code.ai
- init-project.sh copies tests.ai → .claude/rules/tests.ai
- Pin Ruby version in .ruby-version
